{"product_id":"the-moneypenny-diaries","title":"The Moneypenny Diaries","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Moneypenny Diaries is a series of novels and short stories chronicling the life of Miss Moneypenny, M's personal secretary in Ian Fleming's James Bond series; it is considered an official spin-off of the Bond books. The diaries are penned by Samantha Weinberg under the pseudonym Kate Westbrook, who is depicted as the book's \"editor.\"\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 111 x 19\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kate Westbrook\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780719567773\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 312\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45905859838105,"sku":"12RD9780719567773","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691aa294157c9_The_Moneypenny_Diaries.jpg?v=1763396516","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-moneypenny-diaries","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}